      "display_title": "Issue #1826: Angular Style System Refactor",
      "main_description_html": "<h2 dir=\"auto\">Objective</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Refactor the Angular application's global and component styles into a consistent, maintainable style system while preserving the current rendered design and behavior. The Virtual Gallery Editor is the pilot; the proven approach then rolls out across the application.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Program constraints</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>The current UI is the visual source of truth; this program is not a redesign.</li>\n<li>Geist is the product UI font.</li>\n<li>Geist Mono is opt-in for technical values only.</li>\n<li>The Editor's user-selectable content font catalogue, asset mappings, weights, styles, previews, and rendered content must remain unchanged.</li>\n<li>Tokens use primitive → semantic → narrowly proven shared-component layers.</li>\n<li>Feature styles live with Angular component owners; shared third-party shell behavior stays global.</li>\n<li>PrimeNG dialog work follows the repository contract under <code class=\"notranslate\">src/assets/scss/primeNg/dialog/</code>: shared shell globally, feature body locally, unique dialog wrappers, and an import-only <code class=\"notranslate\">dialog/_index.scss</code>.</li>\n<li>Bootstrap remains only during compatibility migration and is removed after all active consumers have app-owned behavior.</li>\n<li>Each deletion requires consumer/cascade evidence and visual verification.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Execution checklist</h2>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Phase 0 — Reproducible baseline</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5138760457\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1804\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1804/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1804\">#1804</a> — Capture visual baselines and CSS metrics</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Phase 1 — Foundations with compatibility intact</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5138761536\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1805\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1805/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1805\">#1805</a> — Make Sass settings pure and order the global entry point</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5138762285\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1806\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1806/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1806\">#1806</a> — Establish design tokens and repair layout custom properties</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5138763266\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1807\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1807/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1807\">