88851\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1817\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1817/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1817\">#1817</a> — Migrate Settings, Profile, and Account styles</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5138789836\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1818\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1818/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1818\">#1818</a> — Migrate Billing, Subscription, and Pricing Plan styles</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5138796230\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1819\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1819/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1819\">#1819</a> — Migrate Support and Promocodes styles</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5138797156\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1820\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1820/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1820\">#1820</a> — Migrate authentication flow styles</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5138798131\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1821\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1821/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1821\">#1821</a> — Migrate Create Exhibition and shared-dialog styles</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5138799075\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1822\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1822/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1822\">#1822</a> — Migrate public and marketing page styles</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5138799947\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1823\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1823/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1823\">#1823</a> — Migrate FAQ, Tutorials, API Tester, maintenance, and model tester styles</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Phase 5 — Bootstrap removal</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5138806196\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1824\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1824/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1824\">#1824</a> — Remove Bootstrap SCSS and compatibility utilities</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Phase 6 — Final legacy cleanup and verification</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5138807353\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1825\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1825/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/GoThruMedia/villume-admin/issues/1825\">#1825</a> — Complete final legacy cleanup and full-app visual verification</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Required workflow per implementation issue</h2>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Preserve unrelated dirty-worktree changes.</li>\n<li>Capture or select the relevant baseline and interaction states.</li>\n<li>Audit consumers and cascade before moving or deleting selectors.</li>\n<li>Change one responsibility at a time: foundation, ownership, typography, or deletion.</li>\n<li>Run selector/dependency searches, focused tests, and <code class=\"notranslate\">pnpm test:styles</code>.</li>\n<li>Run the Angular build required by AGENTS.md.</li>\n<li>Compare desktop/mobile screenshots and supported themes.</li>\n<li>Treat unexplained visual differences as a failed batch; retain scoped compatibility until the cause is understood.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Program definition of done</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">src/styles.scss</code> is ordered and import-only.</li>\n<li>Component-imported Sass configuration emits no CSS.</li>\n<li>Product UI uses Geist; approved technical surfaces use Geist Mono.</li>\n<li>The complete Editor user-content font catalogue remains intact.</li>\n<li>Shared tokens/primitives have demonstrated consumers and feature-specific CSS has a clear component owner.</li>\n<li>PrimeNG shared dialog shells are global and feature dialog bodies are local.</li>\n<li>Bootstrap imports, mixins, dependency, standard grid/utilities, and temporary compatibility are removed.</li>\n<li>Unscoped native checkbox/radio hiding is removed.</li>\n<li>Remaining <code class=\"notranslate\">ViewEncapsulation.None</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">::ng-deep</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">!important</code>, raw colors, and compatibility exceptions are minimal and documented.</li>\n<li>Full application visual baselines, style tests, focused tests, and required builds pass.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Ordering</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Work follows the phase order above. Issues within a phase may run in parallel only when they do not share selector ownership or foundation dependencies. The Bootstrap removal and final cleanup issues are hard gates and must remain last.</p>",
